# Unprivileged sshd: it can only log in the user it runs as.
Port 2222
PasswordAuthentication no
KbdInteractiveAuthentication no
PubkeyAuthentication yes
PermitRootLogin no
UsePAM no
PermitUserEnvironment yes
AuthorizedKeysFile .ssh/authorized_keys /etc/workspace/authorized_keys
PrintMotd no
Subsystem sftp internal-sftp
